   613	/**
   614	 * gnutls_pkcs12_bag_set_friendly_name:
   615	 * @bag: The bag
   616	 * @indx: The bag's element to add the id
   617	 * @name: the name
   618	 *
   619	 * This function will add the given key friendly name, to the
   620	 * specified, by the index, bag element. The name will be encoded as
